DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31000::$$$message_0222_0000_0000$$$::Sunlight hits my eyelids.[lr]::
31001::$$$message_0222_0000_0001$$$::My awakening consciousness senses the rustling of trees and a cool wind.[lr]::
31002::$$$message_0222_0000_0002$$$::"Mm..."[lr]::
31003::$$$message_0222_0000_0003$$$::My blood vessels begin to work, slowly but surely.[lr]::
31004::$$$message_0222_0000_0004$$$::I've just awakened from a long slumber.::
31005::$$$message_0222_0001_0000$$$::"Ngh... Ah..."[lr]::
31006::$$$message_0222_0001_0001$$$::I rise from the sofa.[lr]::
31007::$$$message_0222_0001_0002$$$::I feel my body and mind creaking from long disuse.[lr]::
31008::$$$message_0222_0001_0003$$$::To be honest, it hurts.[lr]::
31009::$$$message_0222_0001_0004$$$::Attempting to move my arms or think about anything brings agony.[lr]::
31010::$$$message_0222_0001_0005$$$::But joy accompanies the feeling.[lr]::
31011::$$$message_0222_0001_0006$$$::I'd forgotten this pain for so long. Now I can accept a little more of it than before.::
31012::$$$message_0222_0002_0000$$$::"...Whew. Somehow, my body..."[lr]::
31013::$$$message_0222_0002_0001$$$::I can operate it, more or less.[lr]::
31014::$$$message_0222_0002_0002$$$::My left arm doesn't move, but I never had it to begin with.[lr]::
31015::$$$message_0222_0002_0003$$$::I hug my lost arm as if it's still there.[lr]::
31016::$$$message_0222_0002_0004$$$::I can't help the fact that I've lost it.[lr]::
31017::$$$message_0222_0002_0005$$$::I won't run away from that. I'll think of a way to keep using this body.::
31018::$$$message_0222_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31019::$$$message_0222_0003_0001$$$::...The strong sunlight makes me dizzy.[lr]::
31020::$$$message_0222_0003_0002$$$::For an instant, the warmth relaxes me...[lr]::
31021::$$$message_0222_0003_0003$$$::"Hey. You're awake, Master."[lr]::
31022::$$$message_0222_0003_0004$$$::...and behind me,[lr]::
31023::$$$message_0222_0003_0005$$$::I hear a dear voice that I've never heard before.::
31024::$$$message_0222_0004_0000$$$::"A≈ãra...!"[lr]::
31025::$$$message_0222_0004_0001$$$::I turn around, and I'm speechless.[lr]::
31026::$$$message_0222_0004_0002$$$::There's nobody there. There never was.[lr]::
31027::$$$message_0222_0004_0003$$$::He said to keep going.[lr]::
31028::$$$message_0222_0004_0004$$$::His flippant words that were always trying to convince me of something don't exist.::
31029::$$$message_0222_0005_0000$$$::I move from the sofa to the corner of the room.[lr]::
31030::$$$message_0222_0005_0001$$$::In this corner where [font italic=true]someone[font italic=false] used to be...[lr]::
31031::$$$message_0222_0005_0002$$$::There lies a forgotten item, like a farewell gift.::
31032::$$$message_0222_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31033::$$$message_0222_0006_0001$$$::It's a simple white flower.[lr]::
31034::$$$message_0222_0006_0002$$$::He's tried countless times to create something like this.[lr]::
31035::$$$message_0222_0006_0003$$$::It's a puzzle without a center, which should be impossible to finish.[lr]::
31036::$$$message_0222_0006_0004$$$::And in the end, he finished it by filling in himself.::
31037::$$$message_0222_0007_0000$$$::"You dummy. You can find something like this anywhere..."[lr]::
31038::$$$message_0222_0007_0001$$$::It's a plain picture.[lr]::
31039::$$$message_0222_0007_0002$$$::A painting of no significant worth.[lr]::
31040::$$$message_0222_0007_0003$$$::But to him, it was priceless.[lr]::
31041::$$$message_0222_0007_0004$$$::It won't ever receive any accolades. It won't catch anyone's eye.[lr]::
31042::$$$message_0222_0007_0005$$$::He left its simple beauty here.::
31043::$$$message_0222_0008_0000$$$::"...Aaah..."[lr]::
31044::$$$message_0222_0008_0001$$$::A drop rolls down my cheek.[lr]::
31045::$$$message_0222_0008_0002$$$::My chest feels hot.[lr]::
31046::$$$message_0222_0008_0003$$$::I finally learn that people can cry out of happiness. It's something I never learned as a child.[lr]::
31047::$$$message_0222_0008_0004$$$::My chest tightens with regret and gratitude.[lr]::
31048::$$$message_0222_0008_0005$$$::I regret that there might have been a better way.[lr]::
31049::$$$message_0222_0008_0006$$$::My eyes feel hot at the thought of the days I spent with that Servant.::
31050::$$$message_0222_0009_0000$$$::"Let's continue the Holy Grail War, Bazett. This time, we'll definitely make your wish..."[rf]::
31051::$$$message_0222_0010_0000$$$::I'm hearing things.[lr]::
31052::$$$message_0222_0010_0001$$$::He desired such a relationship until the end.[lr]::
31053::$$$message_0222_0010_0002$$$::I managed to carry on because I knew that.[lr]::
31054::$$$message_0222_0010_0003$$$::Did I do a good job?[lr]::
31055::$$$message_0222_0010_0004$$$::Us going our separate ways as untrustworthy partners instead of making it a sad farewell, just as he wanted.::
31056::$$$message_0222_0011_0000$$$::...If I did do a good job, then I can proudly say goodbye.[lr]::
31057::$$$message_0222_0011_0001$$$::If I managed to honor that show-off's tiny, insignificant pride until the end,[lr]::
31058::$$$message_0222_0011_0002$$$::then we must have been the best partners.::
31059::$$$message_0222_0012_0000$$$::"...Well, this is it. Goodbye, Avenger."[lr]::
31060::$$$message_0222_0012_0001$$$::The sun is high in the sky.[lr]::
31061::$$$message_0222_0012_0002$$$::It must be noon.[lr]::
31062::$$$message_0222_0012_0003$$$::I check my belongings.[lr]::
31063::$$$message_0222_0012_0004$$$::"...?"[lr]::
31064::$$$message_0222_0012_0005$$$::I realize that one of my left-hand gloves is missing.[lr]::
31065::$$$message_0222_0012_0006$$$::Maybe he has a habit of stealing things, or maybe he's just a coward.[lr]::
31066::$$$message_0222_0012_0007$$$::If he was going to take it, he could've taken the whole pair.::
31067::$$$message_0222_0013_0000$$$::There's so much I have to do.[lr]::
31068::$$$message_0222_0013_0001$$$::I've been out of contact for the last half year. If the Holy Grail War is over, then I must be presumed dead.[lr]::
31069::$$$message_0222_0013_0002$$$::"...In any case, I need to get a prosthetic."[lr]::
31070::$$$message_0222_0013_0003$$$::My position at the Mage's Association is probably long gone, so I'll have to do some thinking about how to conduct myself going[line len=2]::
31071::$$$message_0222_0014_0000$$$::"Was that...?"[lr]::
31072::$$$message_0222_0014_0001$$$::I think I heard a voice that wasn't just a bird chirping.[lr]::
31073::$$$message_0222_0014_0002$$$::...Argh, this half-year blank is really throwing me off.[lr]::
31074::$$$message_0222_0014_0003$$$::My curiosity overrides my caution, and I creep up to the window.[lr]::
31075::$$$message_0222_0014_0004$$$::I hear multiple sets of footsteps.[lr]::
31076::$$$message_0222_0014_0005$$$::I spot a familiar boy and girl coming up the hill and past the trees.::
31077::$$$message_0222_0015_0000$$$::"Hmm. So this is the haunted mansion I've heard about... It doesn't really look like one, though. Do we really need to check it out?"[lr]::
31078::$$$message_0222_0015_0001$$$::"What are you talking about? We already came all this way, and you're the one who said we should make time to study it. Or what, did you get cold feet?"[lr]::
31079::$$$message_0222_0015_0002$$$::"A-as if! I won't get scared of a ghost or two!"[lr]::
31080::$$$message_0222_0015_0003$$$::"That's the spirit. Come on, let's go. I've actually been curious about this place myself..."::
31081::$$$message_0222_0016_0000$$$::The boy and girl walk up to the door, chatting idly.[lr]::
31082::$$$message_0222_0016_0001$$$::Strangely, I don't feel hostile toward them.[lr]::
31083::$$$message_0222_0016_0002$$$::In fact, childish mischief springs to mind.[lr]::
31084::$$$message_0222_0016_0003$$$::I relish the thoughts that, if I'm this supposed ghost, then they might appreciate me giving them a little scare[line len=2]but then I hear the door unlock.::
31085::$$$message_0222_0017_0000$$$::"No time to think.[lr]::
31086::$$$message_0222_0017_0001$$$::...Now, how should I greet them for the first time?"::
31087::$$$message_0222_0018_0000$$$::I smile and wait at the window for my guests.[lr]::
31088::$$$message_0222_0018_0001$$$::He told me to move on.[lr]::
31089::$$$message_0222_0018_0002$$$::Right now, that's enough.[lr]::
31090::$$$message_0222_0018_0003$$$::I don't have the answers yet, but it doesn't sound like a bad idea to keep running and wrangling with those problems while making a fool of myself.[lr]::
31091::$$$message_0222_0018_0004$$$::I'm sure it'll be as hard as always, but I'll enjoy it a little, too.::
31092::$$$message_0222_0019_0000$$$::"First, I'll go see the peaceful life that you led, in this town where I crossed the sea."::
31093::$$$message_0222_0020_0000$$$::I think about the time I will live from now.[lr]::
31094::$$$message_0222_0020_0001$$$::The lively footsteps are close now.[lr]::
31095::$$$message_0222_0020_0002$$$::I say farewell to those four days only I know of but never happened...and I welcome the fifth.[sestop time=3000 nowait=true][nolr][p]::
931030::$$$message_9222_0005_0001$$$::In this corner where [font italic=true]someone[font italic=false] used to be... There lies a forgotten item, like a farewell gift.::ùÓ